# P5 framework depth (ruby): Sequel raw SQL.

test "ruby: params -> Sequel DB.fetch is SQLi"
  lang ruby
  expect VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  def index
    name = params[:name]
    DB.fetch("SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '" + name + "'")
  end
  ```

test "ruby: a constant Sequel query is clean"
  lang ruby
  reject VYQL-INJ-001
  code
  ```
  def index
    DB.fetch("SELECT * FROM users")
  end
  ```
